21 T tail 10.8503 11.063 1.0825e+13 low-confidence  Below 1e-3 of the peak the light is controlled by groups being retired when they slow below v_dark = 3.0 km/s and by the tau taper (2-4 km/s). Do not interpret structure below this level.
